---
import Container from "./Container.astro"
---

<div class="relative py-24">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-max w-full m-auto grid grid-cols-2 -space-x-52 opacity-40 dark:opacity-30">
    <div class="blur-[120px] h-64 bg-gradient-to-br from-bluedsc to-purple-500 dark:from-blue-700"></div>
    <div class="blur-[120px] h-40 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-sky-300 dark:to-indigo-600"></div>
  </div>

  <Container>
    <div class="relative">
      <div class="relative rounded-[3rem] border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/10 bg-white/40 dark:bg-gray-900/40 backdrop-blur-3xl px-8 py-16 shadow-2xl shadow-gray-600/10 dark:shadow-none overflow-hidden">
        
        <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-64 h-64 bg-bluedsc/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
        
        <div class="relative m-auto space-y-8 md:w-10/12 lg:w-8/12 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white md:text-6xl leading-tight">
            ¿Listo para llevar tu negocio al <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-bluedsc to-cyan-500 dark:from-blue-400 dark:to-cyan-300">futuro digital?</span>
          </h2>
          
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-xl mx-auto">
            Únete a las empresas que ya han optimizado su operación y blindado su seguridad con la experiencia integral de <strong>DealStudio</strong>.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6">
            <a
              href="https://wa.me/4425573314"
              class="group relative flex h-14 w-full items-center justify-center px-8 transition-all duration-300 sm:w-max"
            >
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-bluedsc transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105 shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/30"></div>
              <span class="relative flex items-center gap-2 text-base font-bold text-white">
                Cotizar mi proyecto
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
                </svg>
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="/#features"
              class="group relative flex h-14 w-full items-center justify-center px-8 transition-all duration-300 sm:w-max"
            >
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white/50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"></div>
              <span class="relative text-base font-bold text-gray-700 dark:text-white">
                Explorar servicios
              </span>
            </a>
          </div>
          
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 pt-4">
             Respuesta inmediata por WhatsApp · Sin compromisos
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</div>